<Layout title="Darth MakeASavingThrow" active="The Storyteller">
  <section class="detail-hero"><div class="page-wrap"><p class="kicker">Archive dedication // voiceprint unknown</p><h1>Darth<br />MakeASavingThrow</h1><p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px">Behind the hood is a quick tongue, a dozen voices, and a talent for making every corridor, palace, and collapsing tower feel occupied.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="page-wrap"><div class="quote-panel"><div><p class="kicker">Under the hood</p><p class="mono text-muted">IDENTITY: CLASSIFIED</p></div><div><blockquote>“We never see the face. We always hear the next complication.”</blockquote><cite>— the crew, with varying levels of trust</cite></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="page-wrap detail-grid"><div><p class="kicker">A formal appreciation</p><h2>He brings the characters alive.</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px">Through the hood comes the galaxy: the officer with the wrong smile, the droid with a question, the Hutt with a palace full of bad decisions. Darth MakeASavingThrow gives each of them a voice, then leaves us to deal with the consequences.</p></div><div class="plate about-card"><p class="kicker">Storyteller rating</p><h3>Many voices.<br />One menace.</h3><p style="margin-top:20px">The archive cannot confirm whether the hood is ceremonial, tactical, or simply very comfortable. It can confirm the stories keep moving.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
